## Overview
This log captures commands and results for training our Energy-Based Binary LM (EBM) on Golden Mean and Even Process, evaluating next-token metrics, generating representation visualizations, computing redundancy and CKA, and comparing briefly to the nanoGPT experiments in `docs/experiments_golden_mean.md`.

## Code & Data
- Model: `notebook_experiments/ebt/models.py`
- Train/Eval: `notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py`, `notebook_experiments/ebt/eval_ebm.py`, `notebook_experiments/ebt/check_even_dataset.py`
- Visualization: `notebook_experiments/ebt/viz_generate_ebm.py`, `notebook_experiments/ebt/viz_metrics_ebm.py`
- Viz utilities (reused): `nanoGPT/rep_viz.py`
- Datasets:
  - GM: `/home/matteo/NeuralCSSR/notebook_experiments/golden_mean/data/golden_mean/golden_mean.dat`
  - Even: `/home/matteo/NeuralCSSR/notebook_experiments/even_process/even_process.dat`

## Environment
- Use `uv run --with torch` for GPU-aware runs; `--amp` and `--tf32` optional on Ampere+.

## Golden Mean — Train (subset ~10k)
Command:
```bash
uv run --with torch python /home/matteo/NeuralCSSR/notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py \
  --preset golden_mean --device auto --amp --tf32 \
  --max_tokens 10000 \
  --context_window 64 --epochs 3 --steps_per_epoch 500 --batch_size 64 \
  --d_model 128 --layers 4 --heads 8 --dropout 0.1 --lr 3e-4
```
Artifacts:
- CKPT: `/home/matteo/NeuralCSSR/notebook_experiments/golden_mean/ebm_ckpt.pt`
- CSV: `/home/matteo/NeuralCSSR/notebook_experiments/golden_mean/ebm_metrics.csv`

Observed (from CSV, final epoch):
- val_loss ≈ 0.4549 nats (0.6563 bits), ppl ≈ 1.5760
- p(0|0) ≈ 0.0037, p(0|1) ≈ 0.5531, zero_violation ≈ 0.0

